      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/dome-fire-2.jpeg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🪶 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.outsideonline.com%2Foutdoor-adventure%2Fexploration-survival%2Fyosemite-dome-fire-chilnualna-falls%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/dome-fire-2.jpeg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🪶 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.outsideonline.com%2Foutdoor-adventure%2Fexploration-survival%2Fyosemite-dome-fire-chilnualna-falls%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"If You Hiked the Chilnualna Falls Trail in September, Yosemite Rangers May Want To Talk to You\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/dome-fire-2.jpeg?width=1200\" /></figure>\n<p>Yosemite National Park is asking hikers who visited Chilnualna Falls Trail to report illegal campfires as the Dome Fire reaches 4,200 acres near Mariposa Grove.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/outdoor-adventure/exploration-survival/yosemite-dome-fire-chilnualna-falls/\">If You Hiked the Chilnualna Falls Trail in September, Yosemite Rangers May Want To Talk to You</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
